+# Prioritization Matrix
+
+Score each criterion 1-5. Clients may adjust weights to reflect strategy, risk tolerance, and compliance obligations.
+
+| Recommendation | Customer Impact | Business Value | Urgency | Strategic Alignment | Risk Reduction | Compliance Obligation | Dependency Enablement | Effort | Technical Complexity | Confidence | Weighted Score |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| REC-001 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
+
+Sample formula: `(customer impact*3 + business value*3 + urgency*2 + strategic alignment*2 + risk reduction*2 + compliance obligation*2 + dependency enablement + confidence) - (effort*2 + technical complexity)`.
