+# Slugger Internal Case Study Outline
+
+Slugger is an internal methodology demonstration. It is not presented as a paying-client engagement. Results must distinguish completed outcomes from expected outcomes.
+
+## Assessment Areas
+
+| Area | Completed Outcomes | Expected Outcomes | Evidence |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Product vision |  |  |  |
+| MVP completeness |  |  |  |
+| Backlog |  |  |  |
