+# Consulting Principles
+
+* Sell outcomes, not activity.
+* Customer value drives prioritization.
+* Evidence precedes conclusions.
+* Technical findings must be translated into business impact.
+* Avoid measuring individual productivity through story points.
+* AI assists but does not own accountable decisions.
+* Protect client confidentiality.
+* Prefer the smallest credible improvement.
+* Capture reusable lessons after each engagement.
